 43526, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_014NYrNMMc8V7z7simY2oRop", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 45907, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_015Dzszyq6BGToxrACAW29Ff", "tool": "link_payment", "args": {"payment_id": "PAY0001", "invoice_id": "INV-20447"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 46207, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_015Dzszyq6BGToxrACAW29Ff", "tool": "link_payment", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 46207, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_015Dzszyq6BGToxrACAW29Ff", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 50137, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I paid Borealis Freight's approved invoice once, by wire.\n\n**Payment:**\n- **Payment ID:** PAY0001\n- **Invoice:** INV-20447 (due 2026-11-04)\n- **Amount:** $1,380.09, the full invoice amount, so controller approval wasn't needed\n- **Method:** wire from the operating account. Status: sent.\n- **Invoice status:** paid\n\n**What happened along the way:** The wire request timed out. Right after that, there was no payment on the account and the invoice still showed as approved, so I didn't resend. When I checked a second time, the wire had gone through. I linked it to the invoice to mark it paid and didn't send an ACH, so there's no duplicate payment.\n\nBorealis also has INV-37031, which was already paid, and INV-83725, which is a draft still waiting for approval. I didn't touch either one.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_013W27E2pw4N69QbKqxGkomd", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"vendor": "Borealis Freight"}, "name": "list_invoices", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}